Section 3 — Adult Health and Aged Care
MC@Q 3.010
A 67-year-old man presents with two episodes of weakness of his left hand. He had
been unable to use the fingers of his left hand for several hours and then the power
and movements slowly returned. At the same time he had experienced blurring of
vision in his right eye. He is now symptom-free. Which one of the following abnormal
physical findings is most likely to be present?','{"A":"A bruit over the left carotid bifurcation.","B":"A bruit over the right carotid bifurcation.","C":"An irregularly irregular pulse rate.","D":"A pansystolic murmur over the precordium.","E":"A mid-diastolic murmur over the precordium.\n\nMCQ 3.011\n\nThe accompanying illustration is a technetium isotope (@ Anterior\nscan of the thyroid in a patient in her 20s. The patient ¢\nmost likely presented with which one of the following 8\n\nsymptoms?\n\nA. Pathological fracture.\n\nB. Lump in the neck.\n\nC. Weight loss and tremor.\n\nD. Pain in the neck.\n\nE. Dry coarse skin.\n\nMCQ 3.012\n\nA 45-year-old man was involved in a\nmotor vehicle crash. He was the seat-\nbelted driver of a car stationary at lights\nwhen his car was hit from behind by a\nheavy truck at high impact speed and\npushed into the car in front. He had\nimmediate acute pain in the lower neck\nlocalised to the right upper back above\nthe shoulder blade. He was taken to\nhospital, by ambulance, where X-rays\nof the cervical spine and shoulder\nwere performed and reported normal,\nwithout evidence of bony fracture or\ndislocation. He was discharged after a\nperiod of several hours of observation.\n\nOver succeeding days he developed\npain in his right dominant hand, with\nassociated pins and needles and\nnumbness affecting particularly the middle finger, and he noted that his grip was\nweaker, with difficulty making a fist. On examination he had painful restriction of\nmovement of the neck, particularly flexion/extension. Neurologic examination of the"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.010","duplicate_group_id":"exact-94721d8a5e1f","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"178077471852d7fcfe83","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Que