MCQ 3.024
A 65-year-old patient presents at 8pm to the Emergency Department with a right-
sided acutely painful red eye of three hours duration. The eye shows corneal and
scleral injection and oedema, with an irregular pupil reacting sluggishly to light. Which
one of the following is the most likely diagnosis?','{"A":"Acute angle-closure glaucoma.","B":"Primary open angle glaucoma.","C":"Acute iritis.","D":"Foreign body.","E":"Conjunctivitis.\n\n215\n_"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"3.024","duplicate_group_id":"exact-f0d7a763c219","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"4891f87bb12cead405c7","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":233,"source_qid":"3.024"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"4891f87bb12cead405c7","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":233,"source_qid":"3.024","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"tae Se Sa Australian Medical Council\nMCQ 3.024\nA 65-year-old patient presents at 8pm to the Emergency Department with a right-\nsided acutely painful red eye of three hours duration. The eye shows corneal and\nscleral injection and oedema, with an irregular pupil reacting sluggishly to light. Which\none of the following is the most likely diagnosis?","options":{"A":"Acute angle-closure glaucoma.","B":"Primary open angle glaucoma.","C":"Acute iritis.","D":"Foreign body.","E":"Conjunctivitis.\n\n215\n_"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["duration"],"likely_visual